          <span class="badge">LIVE DEMO</span>
          <h2>Jakarta Is Sinking</h2>
          <p>Sentinel-1 radar over 261 kelurahan, 2017–2023. Central Jakarta now falls at
          3.8 mm a year, down from 8.6 — while Pekalongan accelerates past 11 cm. The fastest
          ground in Jakarta is <b>no longer on the coast</b>: it is inland in the west, where the
          groundwater-free zone does not reach.</p>
          <span class="meta">INSAR · SENTINEL-1 · 261 KELURAHAN · SUBSIDENCE HALVED SINCE 2016</span>
