          <span class="badge">LIVE DEMO</span>
          <h2>Transit Access &amp; Urban Equity</h2>
          <p>Four transit systems on one routing graph. An hour of scheduled public transport buys
          Jakarta’s median resident 4.29% of the region’s job-dense floorspace and Bodetabek’s 0.05%
          — but <b>34 kelurahan, 739,629 people</b>, live within 10 km of more of it than average and
          reach none of it at all.</p>
          <span class="meta">GTFS · OSM · R5 ROUTING · 1,511 KELURAHAN · 11 REVIEW TESTS</span>
