          <span class="badge">LIVE DEMO</span>
          <h2>Rice &amp; Food Security</h2>
          <p>Sentinel-1 radar reads Java’s paddy through monsoon cloud — 1.23 million cells,
          1.18 million crop cycles, against 6,240 official BPS regency-months. All five checks fail,
          and the review <b>overturned our own first diagnosis</b>: three quarters of the shortfall is
          fields the radar never sees, and what decides that is how often the satellite looks.</p>
          <span class="meta">SENTINEL-1 RTC · 6 KABUPATEN · 5 CHECKS RED · DIAGNOSIS OVERTURNED</span>
        </div>
